# NOTE: Keep `.envrc` TRACKED!
# Remove `.envrc` from here to version it properly.

# ========== Git hooks & pre-commit ==========
# You SHOULD track `.pre-commit-config.yaml` and `.pre-commit-hooks.yaml`!
# So remove them from ignore.
# Only ignore local caches.
.cache-pre-commit/
.pre-commit-config.local.yaml
.pre-commit-config.yaml~
.pre-commit-hooks.yaml~

